      "writtenOn": "2024-01-19T23:58:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There were a couple of reasons that I split things out:\n\n - AndroidMkData has `Entries AndroidMkEntries` while AndroidMkEntriesProvider.AndroidMkEntries returns `[]AndroidMkEntries`\n - In both cases, UpdateAndroidMk{Entries,Data} need to have SingletonContext, but only have the subset in `fillIn{Entries,Data}Context`.  I suppose I could add `ModuleName(Module)` and whatever `SingletonModuleProvider` needs.\n \nThoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "c9af6875_df508e74",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 951,
